+accuracy of 98.04% (5616/5728), demonstrating strong performance. To determine the optimal
+AE model structure for defect classification using the preprocessed images (processed through
+noise reduction and dynamic ROI assignment) a series of experiments were conducted. The
+number of AE layers was varied (2, 3, and 4 layers), the latent space dimensions were set to
+32, 64, and 128, and the input image sizes were tested at 64 × 64, 128 × 128, and 256 × 256.
+Approximately 5000 images were split into training and test datasets with an 8:2 ratio. Model
+performance was evaluated using accuracy on normal images, accuracy on defective images,
+and overall accuracy. The test dataset included 1137 normal and 33 defective images. Table 3
